{"info": {"address1": "Jagran Building", "address2": "2, Sarvodaya Nagar", "city": "Kanpur", "zip": "208005", "country": "India", "phone": "91 51 2221 6161", "fax": "91 51 2229 8040", "website": "https://www.jplcorp.in", "industry": "Publishing", "industryKey": "publishing", "industryDisp": "Publishing", "sector": "Communication Services", "sectorKey": "communication-services", "sectorDisp": "Communication Services", "longBusinessSummary": "Jagran Prakashan Limited prints and publishes newspapers and magazines in India. It operates through Printing, Publishing and Digital; FM Radio Business; and Others segments. The company offers Dainik Jagran, a daily newspaper; Inext; Nai Dunia & Nav Dunia Rank Hindi newspapers; Mid-day, a compact newspaper; Inquilab; Mid-day Gujarati, a Gujarati newspaper; Punjabi Jagran; Sakhi editorial panel; and Khet Khalihaan, an agricultural magazine. It also operates Jagran.com, an online news and information portal; Naidunia.com, a Hindi news portal; Jagran hitech, offers content on technology, automobiles, and innovation; Punjabijagran.com, a Punjabi news portal; Gujaratijagran.com, a platform for news and content in Gujarati; Onlymyhealth.com, a health and wellness portal; Inquilab.com, an Urdu news portal for social reforms, education, and employment; Vishvas.News, a multilanguage fact-checking platform; Jagran Podcast, a digital streaming platform for podcast; Herzindagi.com, a woman-centric lifestyle and entertainment platform; Inextlive.com, a youth-centric portal; Jagran TV, an OTT platform offering video content; Thedailyjagran.com and mid.day, an English news portal; Jagran Local App; Jagran Fatafat, for sports, entertainment, buzz, and tech content; Jagranjosh.com, an educational and career platform; and Marathijagran.com, a news and content platform. In addition, the company offers media mobile applications; out-of-home (OOH) advertising solutions, which includes hoardings, billboards, transit media, digital OOH, retail signages, in-shop, and out-shop branding; and brand activations, event management, creative services, shoppers and retail marketing, integrated media campaigns, public health programs, and rural marketing conferences and exhibitions. Further, it operates radio stations under the Radio City brand name. The company was founded in 1942 and is based in Kanpur, India. The company is a subsidiary of Jagran Media Network Investment Private Limited.", "fullTimeEmployees": 4852, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Shailesh  Gupta", "age": 56, "title": "MD, Head of Advertisement & Marketing Department and Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 24087000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sandeep  Gupta B.Tech", "age": 61, "title": "Executive President of Technical & Whole-Time Director", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 12480000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Gupta B.Sc.", "age": 63, "title": "Chief Editor of Dainik Jagran & Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1962, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 26975000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Dhirendra Mohan Gupta B.A.", "age": 81, "title": "Whole-Time Director", "yearBorn": 1944, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 28080000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunil  Gupta M. Com.", "age": 63, "title": "Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1962, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 30396000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Satish Chandra Mishra", "age": 62, "title": "Head of Production Department & Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1963, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 4368000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amit  Jaiswal", "age": 48, "title": "CFO, Compliance Officer & Company Secretary", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 2243000, "e